---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Dmytro Teslitsky" type="profile">
  <h1>Dmytro Teslitsky</h1>
  <p>
    I’m a Software Engineer with a passion for solving business problems and
    making the world a better place.
  </p>
  <p>Now <b>OPEN</b> for Consulting Work.</p>
  <p>
    Personality: <a href="https://www.16personalities.com/istp-personality"
      >Virtuoso (ISTP-T)</a
    >
  </p>

  <h3>Links</h3>
  <ul class="social">
    <li><a href="https://github.com/teslitsky">GitHub</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/teslitsky/">LinkedIn</a></li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://t.me/techleadsky">My tech blog in Telegram (🇺🇦)</a>
    </li>
    <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
    <li>
      <span id="contact-email" data-u="ZG15dHJv" data-d="dGVzbGl0c2t5LmluZm8=">
        <span aria-hidden="true">Loading...</span>
        <noscript>dmytro@teslitsky.info</noscript>
      </span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="https://teslitsky.info/cv.pdf">Download CV</a></p>
  <p>
    Soft skills: Problem-solving, Teamwork, Communication, Patience, Empathy.
  </p>
  <p>
    Hard skills and buzzwords: JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, NestJS, Prisma,
    PostgreSQL, MySQL, Docker, K8s, CI/CD, Deploy, ArgoCD, Observability,
    Grafana, Prometheus, Sentry, OpenTelemetry, Redis, BullMQ, MongoDB,
    Express.js, Fastify, Vue.js.
  </p>
  <p>
    English level: <a
      href="https://api.busuu.com/anon/certificates/dbe78a2b392ac7229bbbf23726051e67"
      >A2</a
    >, B1 in progress...
  </p>

  <script>
    (function () {
      const el = document.getElementById('contact-email');
      if (!el) return;

      try {
        const u = atob(el.dataset.u!);
        const d = atob(el.dataset.d!);
        el.textContent = u + '@' + d;
      } catch {}
    })();
  </script>
</Base>
